# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时按平台转换
* text=auto

# Windows 批处理/脚本必须保持 CRLF，避免 cmd.exe 解析问题
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产不做文本转换（这些文件本身已被 .gitignore 排除，此处只做保护）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.glb binary
*.vrm binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
